{#- Advance Scene: what the current scene intention is, and how it is written (creator.advance-scene) -#}
The current scene intention is what the current part of the story is about and should accomplish{% if scene_type %} (the scene type is {{ scene_type.name }}: {{ scene_type.description }}){% endif %}. It guides the director and the characters through this part of the story.

It should be written as a short, forward-looking statement of what this part of the story is about and where it is going next, not as a summary of what has happened.
